      "name": "QuickDeliver \u2014 a small delivery-order business",
      "summary": "A fictional small delivery business called QuickDeliver stores its data in three SQL tables: customers (who placed orders), orders (each delivery request), and products (items available for delivery). The schema is introduced in sql.relational_model and reused across the whole SQL run.",
